PgN9AbVF7aUndva2V_J4Syz9mlaK71oBKth4c-R7ZlsOtfS4pwys7kwOZa3DNBhWkT-mhUJIgM8ELq50F_83hpu3eZUkKw2EM9GzRoRg4ujwpb-vC5o-JEPPT-WhT9OxxiGHr_DeDJq2ICCbxW1gHXca_zz5RL-PoOb3v5DdNCvYXB33SClWmdRjVZZmu7GHOtZE7yguilDTVIbeNAldEkQldB-JR2cIQZGKEi6EB2CnuINseO-wCGup-GXtwxp_S0pJNnDDqOPvXAanR43dYd1ztJZwi-l368VbMV1qmL2aI5XvoKutoF5fXRV2ga-KC9MvmQPEHvhY0AS-GH0mONRbqIevya5HHEI8T7JYQssM4CnqA9qLMxa_Oo3f7KVjP1D-bTcD8AXCpWMnDK4CQnCyC8tWs6P63LjAnAqpZYK0O8_CU3iO-wQjllYK6UkYO_49RYDgTLtHKCsO1BTWYqIov9-hMr6mCn7xBfQQJPmuXwsDm-VauvS47ALPZmMx4tmWiYP5B7RvUDP26qJwFi1tx72zcgcb1a-ca5yXNzsdSbAZLroPz8aL-0zmlXmSvxPWbPwDjLkS8tAgGBU359qyW0AX4VKOjO4Evae3L5_9X7ITWl6OEbRnzjOm9OhX88N5IPuZAFxq5hFnAmAnMarTi6LnyYwJOZ86IZzjk5vcHfgujhIsbtgf3alWnU1xiABwTl1IM2fhJPu6TpjPxhqeAbO7xzM1X3Nw==","summary":[]},{"id":"msg_0dc7ece660e8d069016ace9d38c93887d2b286d67225059557","type":"message","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"output_text","annotations":[],"logprobs":[],"text":"```python\nimport itertools\nimport json\n\n# Adjective classes, including the novel adjectives occurring in the options.\nclasses = {\n    \"opinion\": \"lovely silly good wonderful awful terrible ridiculous mysterious repulsive nice\",\n    \"size\": \"huge large medium-size normal-size midsize tiny massive enormous small\",\n    \"age\": \"ancient archaic new old old-fashioned brand-new\",\n    \"shape\": \"spherical rectangular prismlike circular square triangular pyramidal\",\n    \"color\": \"maroon blue black magenta white gray crimson violet green brown yellow indigo pink\",\n    \"origin\": \"bangladeshi mexican egyptian vietnamese american brazilian pakistani russian thai nigerian iranian japanese german ethiopian filipino indian turkish\",\n    \"material\": \"paper glass wool leather wood cloth fiberglass rubber cardboard plastic steel\",\n    \"purpose\": \"hiking walking driving drinking exercise smoking typing eating snorkeling whittling\",\n}\ncategory = {\n    word: name\n    for name, words in classes.items()\n    for word in words.spl